## Search index

Each build writes `search_index.json` — a JSON array, one entry per page,
with the title, URL, a text summary and the page's top keywords. Terms are
lowercased, stop words are dropped, and light suffix stemming is applied.

Query the index from the command line:

```console
$ quaydoc search fragment checker site
/guide/links/  Links and references
/guide/building/  Building a site
```

## Sitemap

`sitemap.xml` lists every built page with its last-modified date where one
is known.

## Atom feed

When `[build] rss` is enabled, `feed.xml` is an Atom feed with one entry per
page. Entries use the page's `date` front matter value when present and the
build time otherwise.
